## Item Archived email message
## This message is sent to a submitter when Infoscience curator
## has approved the submission, and the item is maked available into
## the repository.
##
## {0}  Title of the item
## {1}  The handle identifier of the item
## {2}  The submitters full name
##
#set($subject = "Infoscience submission approved and available : ${params[0]}")

Dear ${params[2]},

Thank you for your submission to Infoscience repository.
Your publication, "${params[0]}", has been approved and it is now available using the following URL :
${params[1]}

Check out the information for depositors at https://help-infoscience.epfl.ch
- How can I see how often my publication is viewed and downloaded?
- How can I add my publication on my people page?
- Can my publication be submitted in open access?
- and more!

Thanks again for taking this important step to make available and share your research output.

We welcome your feedback! Contact us at infoscience@epfl.ch.

The Infoscience Team
infoscience.epfl.ch